   "stem_html": "True or False. The <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>-intercept of <span data-math=\"y = {\\text{ }}2x{\\text{ }}-8{\\text{ is }}\\left( {0,-8} \\right)\">y = {\\text{ }}2x{\\text{ }}-8{\\text{ is }}\\left( {0,-8} \\right)</span>.",
