     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Substitute 0 for <i>y</i> to find the <i>x</i>-intercept.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y = 2(0) - 8 = - 8\"></span></p>\n<p>(0, –8) is the <i>x-</i>intercept.</p>"
    },
